@startuml F4.2a-carregar-pool-coe
title F4.2a — Carregar pool COE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "COEController" as Ctrl
participant "GetCOEDashboardUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: /comissoes/coe
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /comissoes/coe
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT KPIs + estágios\n(estado != CONCLUIDO)
Postgres --> UC: dados + due_date
UC --> Ctrl: dashboard
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  due_date < now
  → status/danger (client)
end note
WebApp --> Prof: KPIs e tabela

@enduml
